usage: csk skill check [-h] [--locale LOCALE] [--json] path

Validates intrinsic skill requirements in a working tree directory.

positional arguments:
  path             skill directory to validate

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --locale LOCALE  selected locale to validate
  --json           print machine-readable issues

Files read:
  <skill>/SKILL.md, <skill>/agent-skill.json, <skill>/csk-skill.json (legacy),
  <skill>/agents/runtime.json,
  <skill>/locales/metadata.json, <skill>/.skill_triggers.

Notes:
  This command reads the working tree as-is. csk install validates the committed
  git snapshot resolved from Skillfile.json.

Exit codes:
  0 no errors, 1 one or more strict errors.

Examples:
  csk skill check .
  csk skill check /path/to/skill --locale ru
  csk skill check . --json
